CHAPTER.VERS:
Therefore, just as the Ruach Hakodesh says, "HAYOM IM BEKOLO TISHMAU 

          "Today, if you hear His voice"--Tehillim 95:7f
        ;

Therefore "AKUT BEDOR VAOMAR AM TO'EY LEVAV HEM V'HEM LO YADU DERAKHAY" 

          "I was angry with that generation and I said they are a straying-of-heart people and they have not known my ways"
        ;

We have become Chavrusa partners of Rebbe, Melech HaMoshiach  if only our bittachon 

          confidence
         we had initially we hold firm until HaKetz;
